{"id":"n28629-1-28","stage":1,"title":"교과서 · 教科书","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28629-1-28-1","ko":"큰일이네. 교과서를 집에 두고 왔어.","zh":"糟了，我把课本忘在家里了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"큰일이네.","meaning":"大事","explanation":"큰일：大事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"큰일","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72174","senseId":"2","lemma":"큰일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교과서를","meaning":"教科书，教材","explanation":"교과서：教科书，教材；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"교과서","audio":"/audio/82ed6f2233350ed7b388.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28629","senseId":"1","lemma":"교과서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두고","meaning":"撇下，丢下，落","explanation":"두다：撇下，丢下，落；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"3","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔어.","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dbfb08997ec518d3","term":"큰일","zh":"大事","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3","entryId":"72174","definition":"无法挽回的大事故或不好的事情。","pronunciation":["크닐"]},{"id":"82ed6f2233350ed7","term":"교과서","zh":"教科书，教材","audio":"/audio/82ed6f2233350ed7b388.mp3","entryId":"28629","definition":"学校里为教授某个科目而编订的书。","pronunciation":["교ː과서","교ː꽈서"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"撇下，丢下，落","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"不带走，遗留或丢弃。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c6aed38a5dd659c43a1b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28629-1-28-2","ko":"다른 반 친구한테 얼른 빌려 와.","zh":"赶紧向其他班的同学借一本吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친구한테","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빌려","meaning":"借","explanation":"빌리다：借；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와.","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","